      202.61,
      401.9,
      259.91
    ],
    "text": "4.(1) The Board of Trustees shall consist of minimumof three and a maximum of seven Trustees, five of whom areappointed in accordance with the rules of the Corporationand others are appointed by the Board of Trustees as andwhen it is deemed necessary,",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      271.61,
      401.89,
      317.39
    ],
    "text": "(2) Mr. Chulapathmendra Dahanayake shall be thelifetime Trustee shall be the Chairman of the Board ofTrustees of the Foundation Trustees for a period of five yearsfrom the date of commencement of this Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      329.09,
      401.85,
      351.95
    ],
    "text": "(3) The other Trustees shall hold office for a period offive years from the date of commencement of this Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      363.65,
      401.85,
      409.43
    ],
    "text": "(4) Any turstee who may be appointed by the Board ofTrustees of the Foundation Trust shall hold office for a periodof five years or less as deermined at the discretion of theBoard of Trustees.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      421.13,
      401.92,
      466.91
    ],
    "text": "(5) In the event of the death of ChulpathmendraDahanayake the other Trustees shall have the right to elect aperson amongst themselves as Chairman or to appoint a newtrustee in terms of the provision herein contained.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      478.61,
      401.9,
